"entity": {
"name": "Gamma Communications Plc",
"description": "Gamma Communications Plc engages in the provision of technology-based communication services. It operates through the following segments: Gamma Business, Gamma Enterprise, Gamma Germany, Other Europe, and Central Functions. The Gamma Business segment provides communication and connectivity solutions to small and medium-sized businesses. The Gamma Enterprise segment focuses on communication services for larger enterprises and public sector organizations. The Gamma Germany segment comprises the company's operations in Germany. The Other Europe segment includes operations in other European markets, primarily the Netherlands and Spain. The Central Functions segment consists of corporate and administrative functions that support the operating segments. The company was founded in 2001 and is headquartered in Newbury, the United Kingdom.",
